cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If using this research artifact, cite this version and the original BEIR/TREC-COVID sources listed in data/README.md."
type: software
title: "My TREC-COVID Document-Selection Experiments: Method Reimplementation, Extensions and Evaluation"
authors:
  - name: "QronG9"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-05
abstract: "I compare twelve document-selection configurations on all fifty BEIR TREC-COVID queries, preserve my initial five-query experiments, and provide offline recalculation of judgment coverage, observed retrieval metrics, candidate-set comparisons, representation sensitivity, and sharp paired precision bounds."
keywords:
  - information retrieval
  - reproducibility
  - judgment coverage
  - TREC-COVID
